        "content": "<p>myunbin opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15260\">issue #15260</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hi, this issue follows up on #14896 and the linked <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/actions/runs/40439133953/job/121975076723?pr=14896\">verification failure</a>.</p>\n<h4>Feature</h4>\n<p>Add support for constructing 32-bit vector constants, such as <code>i8x4</code>, in <code>iconst_u</code>, together with corresponding verifier specifications.<br>\nFor example, <code>iconst_u(i8x4, 1)</code> should splat 1 into each lane: <code>[#x01 #x01 #x01 #x01]</code>.</p>\n<h4>Benefit</h4>\n<p>This would allow optimization rules that construct constants using <code>iconst_u</code> to apply to these vector types.<br>\nFor example, the following rule requires a vector of ones:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">~</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rule</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">simplify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">isub</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ineg</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bnot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">iconst_u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4>Implementation</h4>\n<p>Extend the vector construction path in <code>iconst_u</code> to support these types using <code>splat</code> and update its verifier spec.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 640102164,
